From: Filippo Falezza <filippo.falezza@outlook.it>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 17:03:12 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 48/69] power: supply: Add Qualcomm QGauge fuel gauge driver

Add a read-only driver for the QGauge (QG) block of the PM7250B PMIC. QG
only measures battery voltage and current; the driver relies on the
configuration the bootloader left, reads the latest ADC voltage and
burst-averaged current every 10 seconds, and estimates the state of
charge by counting charge from a starting point taken from the downstream
driver's SDAM shutdown state or from the open circuit voltage and the
battery's ocv-capacity tables.

The register layout and conversion factors are from the downstream
qpnp-qg driver. There is no binding for "qcom,pm7250b-qg" yet.

This patch was generated by an AI coding assistant (Claude Opus 5.5 in
Claude Code) during an interactive bring-up session on a Motorola Moto G
5G Plus (XT2075-3, "nairo"). It has not yet been reviewed line by line
by a human and needs that review before any submission.

